{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5742cb997355151d88920c706e0d2b3a33d1468bf30e372733730b998bb66261", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのコンセプトを基に、アイドル達の\n宣材写真を新しく撮り直している。今日は、貴音だ）", "zh": "（以39PROJECT的概念为基础，目前正在重新拍摄\n偶像们的宣传照。而今天轮到了贵音。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "cf0246e3cab8dbaea1026ee9810d33f769ad85ebf92aceb460a48440d9219f72", "ja": "いかがでしょう……{$P$}の\nお眼鏡に適う写真は、撮れていますか？", "zh": "请问如何呢……有拍出\n让{$P$}中意的照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "959bee799fdeba874518cc7f20fc526c60673860443247660cd969068c62c10a", "ja": "ああ、さすが貴音だな。\nどの写真も、すごくいい感じだよ。", "zh": "当然有，不愧是贵音。\n每张照片感觉都很棒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "6450ab169cf12538a51699b6546e74463062e3423e2d821c9e01e3cc91954175", "ja": "そうでしたか。\n……ふふっ。", "zh": "这样啊……\n呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1004_p", "source_sha256": "69c8402b820e89e0e0861dd36724057fc88a162d33c04972d89e723fc3614edf", "ja": "ん？　急にどうしたんだ、貴音。\n何か、面白いものでも写ってたのか？", "zh": "嗯？怎么突然笑了，贵音？\n有拍到什么有趣的画面吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "7783a34419f70d91efdeefdcd172fc2b530e53cdf359c1071460fee3956a6b12", "ja": "いいえ、そうではないのです。\nただ……。", "zh": "不，并不是那样。\n只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "8bbb5b9281b9e96238076ac10eaf1f24ceba66b4df8ac368ffb7728ecb8e8060", "ja": "初めて撮影していただいたのが、\nずいぶん昔のように思えてしまって。", "zh": "想起了第一次让人帮小女子拍照的事，\n感觉已经是很久以前了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "e47c609654588f1e78aee5692d40bb6ea934cf93f6896085d1523d680c715f1e", "ja": "おかしなものですね。\nそれほど時が経ったわけでもありませんのに……。", "zh": "真奇怪呢，\n明明时间也还没过那么久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a939f52c173af19509a3ebb11e0d0cd570217ea51afa94bf20cf184b8ece61ca", "ja": "なるほど……。変化を強く感じるってことは、\nそれだけ貴音も成長したってことかな。", "zh": "原来如此……会觉得变化很大，\n就代表贵音成长了很多吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "0a943df0c5b3a39935f8f6b6f1ef32ef0ef77fe5a23efa14053c2ac51a4fd455", "ja": "だとすれば、それは{$P$}のご指導の\nおかげかと……。真、ありがたきことです。", "zh": "若是如此，应该也是多亏{$P$}\n的指教……着实令人非常感激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c9cca7c61e0224499a31c5f3e05eb274232d5777615225706dced84c9f909298", "ja": "いや、貴音はもともと気品があるし。\n動きのひとつひとつも、どこか雅というか。", "zh": "不，贵音原本就很有气质了。\n你的一举一动也都很高雅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1011_p", "source_sha256": "df812a0bbf78e17add1cbdeba0a70e8a42446fabd6689b1b354eb0629eff046b", "ja": "そういうのは、誰かに習ったりしたのか？", "zh": "这些是有人教你的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "cf2149b16ba540dfab91f3570f74610641289594e7aa577096e08b6e73c26785", "ja": "そうですね。\n礼儀作法の所作のことであれば……。", "zh": "是啊。\n如果是指合乎礼仪规矩的举止……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "1ec11f2c4f9a5b36b1cd8b34fce74d4d56740bc034ce7279f2b75cbb0b505be5", "ja": "四条の家にいる間、じいやにみっちり仕込まれました。\nかなり厳しい教え方でしたが、今は良き思い出です。", "zh": "是小女子还待在四条家时，管家爷爷苦心教导的。\n虽然教法非常严格，现在却认为是很棒的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1014_p", "source_sha256": "94fb6afff3b8e08ceb3f1f66db53c17b1b45a965234bc5786dfddf30da253f4b", "ja": "そ、そうか、じいやさんに……。\n身につけるには、相当な覚悟が要りそうだな。", "zh": "是、是吗，是管家爷爷教的……\n要完全学会，感觉需要相当大的觉悟呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "26643bddd6e68ebaaaa3a5a13336d98c122c3fe8966dfacdc1a47cdcf4797650", "ja": "もしや……、{$P$}、\n礼儀作法にご興味を持たれたのですか？", "zh": "莫非……{$P$}，\n你对礼仪规矩有兴趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7e27678603ee520576a0ea5b36a3571f281b363e87de8b21ad7e0d1377a0238f", "ja": "いや、後輩達に習わせるのにどうかと思って。小さい子\nも多いし、優雅に振る舞えるようになって損はないし。", "zh": "没啦，本想让后辈们学习看看。毕竟不少人\n年纪还小，学会优雅的举止一定是件好事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5ce4f882b235b2636c9ef12ba45957623563878e1b71a963513f194acad4e755", "ja": "ま、でも、すぐには難しそうだな。\nただの思い付きだから、気にしないでくれ。", "zh": "但这件事应该很难速成吧。\n我只是刚好想到而已，不用太在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "fdfe6f3b6b4e72a47c77b9ae0198d47f803129b1975711b5ed63f27249ca4db0", "ja": "{$P$}。よろしければ、私から……\n皆に手ほどきをさせていただけませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}，方便的话，能让小女子……\n来教导大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1020_p", "source_sha256": "07ef7284d5eb6442c1052e7d9e6c72b01142ce5c7d06596b67f62c7af420769f", "ja": "え？\n……でも、いいのか？", "zh": "咦？\n可是……真的能麻烦你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "04a68abe1f8fc4f10eb306ea45a08b0ed89994a95d7aadf102e3718d4fa2d597", "ja": "典礼所作等、まだまだ至らぬ身ではありますが……\n皆が望むのであれば、精一杯務めます。", "zh": "虽然在礼仪规矩方面，小女子尚有需要精进之处……\n如果大家有学习意愿，小女子会全力以赴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_1022", "source_sha256": "bc8dc393447d0d08917e3b2bba3471d519b436933f0179461400da035bfd61cb", "ja": "お願いする", "zh": "请她帮忙", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_2000_p", "source_sha256": "418bb1e4f082d620bbc35d94060ce179c48e41154bc63d177cd9a70718f384a8", "ja": "わかった、ぜひお願いするよ！\n時間を持て余した時だけでいいから。", "zh": "知道了，那当然要请你帮忙了！\n只要有空时教一下就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_2001_008tak", "source_sha256": "fcbd24e89d8d2311dc81b0d41d012e838639a7a0de5299a55068bcc77a798484", "ja": "皆の役に立てるのでしたら、本望というものです。\nそれでは、この力の及ぶ限り……。", "zh": "如果能帮上大家的忙，小女子也心满意足了。\n那么，小女子将竭尽全力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_2002_p", "source_sha256": "ec50a8c33c3edf5d8cdbaae9cd939a8ac79d8dc92c79fc7bf95112c222a2d374", "ja": "ありがとう。みんなも喜ぶと思うよ。貴音の仕草は\nどこを取っても、たおやかで優雅だからな。", "zh": "谢谢你，我想大家也会很高兴的。\n因为贵音的举止不管怎么看，都非常婉约优雅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_2004_p", "source_sha256": "76c4f6d23ad0b5f08dd223e245eff365bc8365e885a8f1a0909c3b0a00c81398", "ja": "さて、じゃあそろそろ続きの撮影を始めようか。\n貴音、準備をしてくれ。", "zh": "那么，差不多该继续拍摄了。\n贵音，请你去准备一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_2006_p", "source_sha256": "88fe1a453c4dbd4683095d805a6b9dff37ef9daedf1ccd39d6c0bffad3f205de", "ja": "貴音？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "贵音？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_2007_008tak", "source_sha256": "6913b893897c5ee890003bd16b8834d268352fba244a4f4d8c5ddce7835d5bdd", "ja": "も、申し訳ありません。\nそのようにおっしゃられると、その……。", "zh": "不、不好意思。\n被你这么一说，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_2008_008tak", "source_sha256": "4a510bf9d32898d293c4f269b8beba532cc77f9bacb67e4ce782b863eda06ded", "ja": "今まで、意識していなかったのですが……何やら、\n急に緊張して参りました。どういたしましょう……。", "zh": "小女子至今都没有特别意识到这些……\n但现在却突然开始紧张了。该怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_2009_p", "source_sha256": "e0c29bd5665e97fee7e3ef67f4cf452cd67c07eea479ba8afca2aaf94e2e8f58", "ja": "ええっ！？\nご、ごめん。余計なこと言ったかな……。", "zh": "咦咦！？\n抱、抱歉。我说了多余的话吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_2010_008tak", "source_sha256": "dcf84187e8ca944a58d85ab78dd44577e90559764b5f89430fabbc8d18c8bd9f", "ja": "いえ……大丈夫です。\nどうか最後まで、見ていてください。", "zh": "不……没事的。\n请你好好看到最后吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_2011_p", "source_sha256": "5eef11dbfda48e09dce3be28156f9d31cc6ef0d03c4bb87e5682ca54d6bec97a", "ja": "（緊張していると口では言いながらも、\n貴音は前半にもまして優雅に、撮影を進めた……）", "zh": "（虽然贵音嘴上说很紧张，\n但她的表现比前半段更优雅，顺利完成了拍摄……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_002_2012_p", "source_sha256": "e2781c745bcd536feca7b3c6b29fd3dfb697b6c8a361bbdf4418da2bd9eb2ffa", "ja": "（環境が変わったことで一番成長したのは、\nむしろ後輩達より、貴音なのかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（面对环境的改变，与后辈们相较之下，\n贵音可能是成长最多的人吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
